      "Replication": "Disabled",
      "Description": "Un paramètre de fonction, utiliser avec des noeuds personnalisés.\r\n\r\nVous pouvez spécifier le type et la valeur par défaut du paramètre. Par exemple,\r\n\r\nentrée: var[]..[]\r\nvaleur: bool = false"
    },
    {
      "ConcreteType": "PythonNodeModels.PythonNode, PythonNodeModels",
      "Code": "# Copyright(c) 2026\r\n# Durmus Bayryam\r\n# K-Finder\r\n\r\nimport sys\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n\r\ntry:\r\n    from sklearn.cluster import KMeans\r\nexcept ImportError as e:\r\n    raise Exception(f\"Failed: {e}\")\r\n\r\ndef find_optimal_k(data, max_k=10):\r\n    X = np.array(data)\r\n    inertias = []\r\n    k_values = list(range(1, max_k + 1))\r\n    \r\n    for k in k_values:\r\n        model = KMeans(n_clusters=k, random_state=42, n_init='auto')\r\n        model.fit(X)\r\n        inertias.append(model.inertia_)\r\n\r\n    x = np.array(k_values)\r\n    y = np.array(inertias)\r\n\r\n    x_norm = (x - x.min()) / (x.max() - x.min())\r\n    denom = (y.max() - y.min())\r\n    if denom == 0:\r\n        return 1, k_values, inertias\r\n    y_norm = (y - y.min()) / denom\r\n\r\n    p1 = np.array([x_norm[0], y_norm[0]])\r\n    p2 = np.array([x_norm[-1], y_norm[-1]])\r\n\r\n    distances = []\r\n    for i in range(len(x_norm)):\r\n        p = np.array([x_norm[i], y_norm[i]])\r\n        distance = np.abs(np.cross(p2 - p1, p1 - p)) / np.linalg.norm(p2 - p1)\r\n        distances.append(distance)\r\n\r\n    best_index = np.argmax(distances)\r\n    optimal_k = k_values[best_index]\r\n\r\n    return optimal_k\r\n\r\n\r\n# OUTPUT\r\nif 'IN' in locals():\r\n    data = IN[0]\r\n    max_k = IN[1] if (len(IN) > 1 and IN[1] is not None) else 20\r\n    suggested_k = find_optimal_k(data, max_k)\r\n    OUT = suggested_k",
      "Engine": "CPython3",
      "VariableInputPorts": true,
      "Id": "c192427ca78a40e3af215195de44aa4b",
